WEBVTT

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:09.250
Go to the sign in page, "/admin/login".

00:00:10.063 --> 00:00:15.792
Type your email in the Email box.

00:00:16.042 --> 00:00:22.042
Type your password in the Password box.

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:27.273
Click Sign in.

00:00:27.523 --> 00:00:33.523
Wait until you see Enter your code.

00:00:34.336 --> 00:00:40.336
Type the 6 digit code from your
app in the Digit 1 of 6 box.

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:46.989
Click Verify.

00:00:47.239 --> 00:00:53.239
Wait until you see
Dashboard. You are signed in.
